          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menahem wod pa Gad owok Tiriza to kidho Samaria, oneko Salum, to lunjo go paka kere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gigipiny man je ma Menahem otimo kiri gi nger m'ocamo iye sereko ondiki i kitawo ma kigana ma mako kwoŋ kerin ma Isiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Menahem owok i Tiriza, oreyo woko tindi madwoŋ Tapuwa kicutho, ji mere, kodi adec m'othoko, kwoŋbedo jokwero tiŋo cingi gin malo rigo. Go obaro kiri iy mon je m'oyido joyac.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
