        },
        {
          "text": "I oro ma piero adek g'abuŋwen ma dhum pa kere Uziya ma Yuda, Menahem wod pa Gad obedo kere Isiraili, aka odhumo i Samaria ma oro apar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go otimo reco kwoŋ Rwoth, cuka ndelo ma tho pere oluwo kite pa kere Yerobowam wod pa Nebat m'omiyo Isiraili timo reco tundo ndelo ma tho pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiglath Pilesa, kere ma Asiria omonjo Isiraili, aka Menahem omiyo go kilo 34,000 ma feza ma dwoŋo go ŋey woridhi dhum pere i Isiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menahem okwanyo pesa wok bongi joŋaŋo ma Isiraili gi romo kisi acel kwoŋ jo culo feza piero abic. Ameno Tiglath Pilesa ogik i piny pere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
