              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jatel pa jolweny pa Pekahia m'ilwoŋo ni Peka wod pa Remalia ocamo rigo sereko gi cwo piero abic ma jowok Giliad, oneko Pekahia kama tek loyo i cel pa kere i Samaria to lunjo go paka kere.",
          "type": "text",
