        {
          "text": "I oro mar'ario ma dhum pa Peka wod pa Remalia paka kere ma Isiraili, Yotham wod pa Uziya obedo kere ma Yuda ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.32",
